----
<REGEX>:(?s).*(SEMANTIC_ARGUMENTS|Duplicate|duplicate).*

statement error
SELECT merged_prs FROM engineering.semantic.github(repository=>upper('example/project'));
----
SEMANTIC_PARAMETER_EXPRESSION

